<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="report-header">
  <div class="label">UNODC Crime Trends Survey &bull; Policy Analysis Report</div>
  <h1>Global Intentional Homicide Trends:<br>A Multi-Dimensional Analysis (1990–2023)</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A comprehensive trend analysis of intentional homicide rates across countries, sexes, and age groups over three decades, drawing on UNODC data. Produced for policy analysts and public safety stakeholders.</div>
